  "sourceTitle": "Seven-Layer Cookie",
  "sourceText": "Seven-Layer Cookie\nBy: Andie Mitchell\nPublished: Saturday, February 13, 2010 - 3:09pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 stick butter or margarine, melted\n2 cups graham cracker crumbs\n1 pkg shredded coconut\n6 ounces butterscotch chips\n6 ounces semi-sweet chocolate chips\n1 can sweetened condensed milk\n1 cup chopped pecans\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Melt the butter or margarine in 9 x 13 pan. Add graham cracker crumbs, stir and press down. Add other ingredients as layers in order listed.  2 Bake at 350 for 30 minutes.",
  "parsedSource": {
